config ZMK_BEHAVIOR_MSC_TEMP_LAYER
    bool "Mouse-scroll behavior that also keeps a temp layer alive"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_BEHAVIOR_MSC_TEMP_LAYER_ENABLED
    depends on ZMK_POINTING
    help
      Each invocation emits a wheel event AND (re-)activates a configured
      keymap layer for a configured duration, so encoder rotation can keep
      the mouse layer alive without trackball motion.
